:: ReturnEvent_Router {"position":"2800,650","size":"100,100"}
/% 귀환 이벤트는 보상 장면이다.
   사건성 귀환 이벤트는 1회만 발생한다.
   기록장에 남기지 않는다. %/
<<run setup.ensureTimeVariables && setup.ensureTimeVariables()>>
<<run setup.ensureEventCooldowns && setup.ensureEventCooldowns()>>
<<set $timeOfDay = "dawn">>
<<set $returnEventPending = false>>

<<set _events = []>>

<<if ($dayCount || $day || 1) >= 2 and not ($returnEventChickenSeen || false) and setup.canRouteEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_Chicken")>>
  <<run _events.push("ReturnEvent_Chicken")>>
<</if>>

<<if ($dayCount || $day || 1) >= 2 and (($kuroTempleNoticeSeen || false) or ($kuroTeaSeen || false) or ($kuroAffection || 0) >= 1) and not ($returnEventWatchKuroSeen || false) and setup.canRouteEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_WatchKuro")>>
  <<run _events.push("ReturnEvent_WatchKuro")>>
<</if>>

<<if ($dayCount || $day || 1) >= 2 and (($genichiroGateSeen || false) or ($genichiroReturnNoticeSeen || false) or ($genichiroConflict || 0) >= 1) and not ($returnEventReedFieldSeen || false) and setup.canRouteEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_ReedField")>>
  <<run _events.push("ReturnEvent_ReedField")>>
<</if>>

<<if ($dayCount || $day || 1) >= 2 and (($hanbeiJustVisitedSeen || false) or ($hanbeiAffection || 0) >= 1 or ($hanbeiConflict || 0) >= 1) and not ($returnEventHanbeiPretendSleepSeen || false) and setup.canRouteEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_HanbeiPretendSleep")>>
  <<run _events.push("ReturnEvent_HanbeiPretendSleep")>>
<</if>>

<<if ($dayCount || $day || 1) >= 3 and (($emmaEventUnlocked || false) or ($emmaIntroducedIsshin || false) or ($isshinUnlocked || false) or ($emmaAffection || 0) >= 1) and not ($returnEventEmmaLampSeen || false) and setup.canRouteEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_EmmaLamp")>>
  <<run _events.push("ReturnEvent_EmmaLamp")>>
<</if>>

<<if ($dayCount || $day || 1) >= 5 and ($shura || 0) >= 6 and not ($returnEventSilentTempleSeen || false) and setup.canRouteEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_SilentTemple")>>
  <<run _events.push("ReturnEvent_SilentTemple")>>
<</if>>

<<if _events.length > 0>>
  <<set _target = _events[random(0, _events.length - 1)]>>
  <<goto _target>>
<<else>>
  <<goto "ReturnEvent_None">>
<</if>>

:: ReturnEvent_None {"position":"2925,650","size":"100,100"}
<<run setup.markRoutedEvent && setup.markRoutedEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_None", 0)>>
<<goto "ReturnToTempleNextDay">>

:: ReturnEvent_WatchKuro {"position":"2925,750","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<run setup.markRoutedEvent && setup.markRoutedEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_WatchKuro", 1)>>
<<set $returnEventWatchKuroSeen = true>>
<<set $kuroAffection = ($kuroAffection || 0) + 1>>
<<set $kuroLove = Math.max(($kuroLove || 0), ($kuroAffection || 0))>>
<<clampStats>>
<<run setup.showToast && setup.showToast("쿠로 인연 +1", "bond")>>
<div class="narration-screen">
<div class="narration narration-block">황폐한 절로 돌아온 뒤에도,
늑대는 한동안 성 쪽을 바라보았다.

멀리,
작은 불빛이 남아 있었다.</div>
</div>

<<continueTo "ReturnEvent_WatchKuro_02">>
<</page>>

:: ReturnEvent_WatchKuro_02 {"position":"3050,750","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration-screen">
<div class="narration narration-block">
그곳에 주군이 있었다.

부르지 않는다.
다가가지도 않는다.

그저,
불이 꺼질 때까지 지켜보았다.</div>
</div>

<<continueTo "ReturnToTempleNextDay">>
<</page>>

:: ReturnEvent_ReedField {"position":"2925,850","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<run setup.markRoutedEvent && setup.markRoutedEvent("return", "ReturnEvent_ReedField", 1)>>
<<set $returnEventReedFieldSeen = true>>
<<set $genichiroConflict = ($genichiroConflict || 0) + 1>>
<<set $genichiroLove = Math.max(($genichiroLove || 0), (($genichiroAffection || 0) + ($genichiroConflict || 0)))>>
<<clampStats>>
<<run setup.showToast && setup.showToast("겐이치로 갈등 +1", "bond")>>
<div class="narration-screen">
<div class="narration narration-block">황폐한 절로 돌아오는 길,
늑대는 성 쪽 갈대밭을 보았다.

바람이 불 때마다
익숙한 검집 소리가 섞여 들리는 듯했다.</div>
</div>

<<continueTo "ReturnEvent_ReedField_02">>
<</page>>

